+     * teardown + guarded fire, nothing more. The {@code readerSocket}
+     * guard rejects a zombie reader that outlived the bounded join and
+     * would otherwise latch a NEWER connection's state. The
+     * restart-requested CAS keeps this latch and the consecutive-timeout
+     * escalation from double-firing a restart for one death (the hung
